      "iconography_notes": "The first fully illustrated minor arcana. Pamela Colman Smith is documented to have viewed photographs of this deck at the British Museum around 1909, the same year she produced the Rider-Waite-Smith deck. Direct iconographic borrowings from the Sola-Busca minor arcana into the RWS are extensively documented.",
